---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { allPartners } from '../lib/partners';
const list = allPartners();
const anyAffiliate = list.some((p) => p.affiliate);
---
<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Lot & Lounge makes money: which outbound links are affiliate links (currently none), and how that never changes the official prices we publish." path="affiliate-disclosure/">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>Lot &amp; Lounge plans to earn money through affiliate commissions: if you click a partner link and book, the partner may pay us a share at no extra cost to you.</p>
    <p><strong>Current status:</strong> {anyAffiliate ? 'some partner links below are affiliate links.' : 'none of our links are affiliate links yet. Partner links point to the plain official websites.'}</p>
    <ul>
      {list.map((p) => <li>{p.name}: {p.affiliate ? 'affiliate link' : 'plain link, no affiliate relationship'}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p>Commissions never change the official rates we publish or the order of the cheapest options. Official airport-run parking is always listed, even when no one pays us for it. We don't recommend credit cards.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
